# Every changelog entry is added at the top of the same "## [Unreleased]" section, so
# any two PRs open at once conflict on that one line however unrelated their code is.
# The resolution is always "keep both bullets", which is exactly what a union merge does.
#
# Union can duplicate a line if two branches edit the SAME bullet — rare here, since
# entries are append-at-top — so give the section a glance after a noisy merge.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
